# Accessibility

- Prefer semantic HTML: `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<button>`
- Interactive UI must be keyboard-accessible — `<button>` over `<div onClick>`
- Meaningful images: descriptive `alt`; decorative: `alt=""`
